[ti:Rug Pull Requiem]
[ar:POISON FM]
[00:03.00]They promised the moon and they pulled the floor
[00:09.13]Liquidity gone, now they lock the door
[00:15.26]Dev went quiet, chat went dark
[00:21.39]Left us holding just a question mark
[00:27.52]Rug pull requiem, slow and low
[00:33.66]Lesson learned, now we know
[00:39.79]Read the contract, check the code
[00:45.92]Never trust a hidden road
[00:52.05]Candles bleeding, red on red
[00:58.18]Every hype coin dead, dead
[01:04.31]Rug pull requiem, sing it twice
[01:10.44]Never pay that rug pull price
[01:16.57]Out of the ashes, build it right
[01:22.71]Open source in the open light
[01:28.84]Rest in peace to the tokens gone
[01:34.97]We hold the lesson, we carry on
